      water ultrafiltration machinery derived from the CAD models or drawings;
  (b) In-operando deployment of the Physics-Informed Bayesian Transformer (PIBT) 
      or XGBoost virtual sensor within commercial plant SCADA, DCS, PLCs 
      (Siemens, Rockwell, Emerson, Yokogawa), or edge microcontrollers;
  (c) Providing fee-bearing diagnostic, maintenance, predictive auditing, or 
      engineering consulting services to industrial operating facilities;
  (d) Commercial deployment of the AERO-PURE water ultrafiltration or continuous 
      electro-deionization (CEDI) designs within semiconductor, pharmaceutical, 
      chemical, power, or refinery facilities.

