4. PATENT & PROPRIETARY IP NOTICE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The unique mathematical coupling of Butler-Volmer electrochemical loss functions 
with self-attention transformers for decoupled biological biofilm isolation, 
as well as the progressive stamping DFM geometry for titanium flow fields with 
integrated O-ring retention grooves, are proprietary intellectual property. 
No patent license, express or implied, is granted to commercial entities absent 
a countersigned license agreement.

